weakspot.client.combo.combodisplayenabled=Show combo
weakspot.client.combo.combodisplayenabled.tooltip=Show your hit streak (combo) on screen.\nCounted like the hit sound's scale: it breaks after about 2 seconds without a hit. Shown from 2.\nFile: client.combo.comboDisplayEnabled
weakspot.client.combo.comboscale=Combo size
weakspot.client.combo.comboscale.tooltip=Size multiplier of the combo number.\nFile: client.combo.comboScale
weakspot.client.combo.comboposition=Combo position
weakspot.client.combo.comboposition.tooltip=Where to show the combo.\nBELOW_CROSSHAIR, RIGHT_OF_CROSSHAIR, TOP_CENTER (below boss bars)\nFile: client.combo.comboPosition
weakspot.client.combo.combomilestoneeffects=Combo step effects
weakspot.client.combo.combomilestoneeffects.tooltip=Accent sound and glow when the combo reaches 10, 25, 50, 100, 250, 500 and 1000 (then every 1000).\nThe higher the step, the bigger the show (fireworks from 500, a title from 1000).\nFile: client.combo.comboMilestoneEffects
weakspot.combo.machine=Machine %sx speed
