weakspot.combo.shots=Shots ×%s
weakspot.combo.title=%s COMBO!
weakspot.growth.dark=Too dark to grow (light %s, needs 9 or more). Light it up with torches (outdoors gets dark at night, too).
weakspot.growth.stuck=No growth after %s hits. Check its surroundings (water, light, space, soil).
weakspot.client.hud.blockhealthbarenabled=Block health bar
weakspot.client.hud.blockhealthbarenabled.tooltip=Show the remaining health of the block you are mining as a green bar along the bottom margin of its face.\nOnly for blocks you mine by holding left click that can have a weak spot.\nFile: client.hud.blockHealthBarEnabled
weakspot.client.hud.machineparticlesvisible=Show particles
weakspot.client.hud.machineparticlesvisible.tooltip=Show the colored particles around boosted machines on your screen.\nTurns off the particles of your machines and of other players' machines alike.\nFile: client.hud.machineParticlesVisible
weakspot.client.markers.weakspottrailenabled=Movement trail
weakspot.client.markers.weakspottrailenabled.tooltip=Animate weak spots as they move: the marker quickly slides to its new place, leaving a short trail.\nVisual only: hits count at the new place immediately. Off switches in place. Also applies to other players' markers.\nFile: client.markers.weakSpotTrailEnabled

key.weakspot.toggle=Toggle All Weak Spots
weakspot.toggle.on=Weak Spots (all): On
weakspot.toggle.off=Weak Spots (all): Off
weakspot.toggle.offReminder=Weak Spots (all): Off (press %s to toggle)
weakspot.client.combo.otherscombodisplay=Show others' combos
weakspot.client.combo.otherscombodisplay.tooltip=Show nearby players' combos (10 or more) above their heads as "n HIT".\nFile: client.combo.othersComboDisplay
weakspot.client.combo.combofactorgaugeenabled=Next multiplier gauge
weakspot.client.combo.combofactorgaugeenabled.tooltip=Show a gauge under the combo count for the progress to the next multiplier step (25, 50, 100...)\nShown only while a weak spot of a kind that uses the combo multiplier is out. Colored like the next step\nFile: client.combo.comboFactorGaugeEnabled
weakspot.client.combo.showothersmilestones=Show others' milestones
weakspot.client.combo.showothersmilestones.tooltip=Show a chat message when another player reaches a milestone\nWhen off, other players' milestones are not shown (your own milestone effects and chat still are)\nFile: client.combo.showOthersMilestones
weakspot.client.hud.machinebarenabled=Machine bars
weakspot.client.hud.machinebarenabled.tooltip=Show progress (yellow) and fuel (orange) bars above furnaces, brewing stands and spawners.\nOnly while their machine weak spot is shown (sneak and hold right click with empty hands).\nFile: client.hud.machineBarEnabled
weakspot.client.hud.growthbarenabled=Growth bar
weakspot.client.hud.growthbarenabled.tooltip=Show a yellow growth bar at the foot of a crop while its weak spot is shown.\nOnly while you hold right click with an empty hand on it.\nFile: client.hud.growthBarEnabled
weakspot.client.markers.othermarkershape=Others' marker shape
weakspot.client.markers.othermarkershape.tooltip=Shape of other players' weak spot markers.\nCIRCLE (filled), RING (hollow), DIAMOND, SQUARE. Your own marker stays a filled circle.\nFile: client.markers.otherMarkerShape
weakspot.client.markers.weakspotsenabled=Show my weak spots
weakspot.client.markers.weakspotsenabled.tooltip=Turn your own weak spots on or off (the Toggle Weak Spots key switches it).\nWhile off, your weak spots do not appear and the game plays as usual. Other players' markers are still shown.\nFile: client.markers.weakSpotsEnabled
weakspot.client.markers.animalspotseethrough=See-through spots
weakspot.client.markers.animalspotseethrough.tooltip=When your weak spot on an animal or enemy is hidden by its body, show the hidden part faintly through it.\nHelps when the body is bigger than the hitbox, such as chickens or zombie arms. Other players' markers are not shown through.\nFile: client.markers.animalSpotSeeThrough
weakspot.client.hud.bowdrawbarenabled=Draw gauge
weakspot.client.hud.bowdrawbarenabled.tooltip=While drawing a bow, show how far it is drawn as a gauge below the crosshair.\nShown regardless of the bow weak spot and of turning weak spots off (HOME key).\nFile: client.hud.bowDrawBarEnabled
weakspot.client.hud.vehicleboostbarenabled=Boost gauge
weakspot.client.hud.vehicleboostbarenabled.tooltip=Show the remaining boost time (light blue) above the crosshair while your vehicle is boosted.\nFile: client.hud.vehicleBoostBarEnabled

