weakspot.guide.keys.title=Keys & menu
weakspot.guide.keys.toggle=%s turns all weak spots on or off. Handy while building.
weakspot.guide.keys.menu=%s opens the menu: stats, hit sounds, markers, settings and this guide.
weakspot.guide.combo.title=Combo & sound
weakspot.guide.combo.combo=Hits in a row count up below the crosshair, across kinds. It ends after 2 s without a hit.
weakspot.guide.combo.sound=Each hit climbs the scale; notes stack at 25 and 100. Bells ring at 10, 25, 50...
weakspot.guide.mining.title=Mining
weakspot.guide.mining.when=While you hold left click to dig a block.
weakspot.guide.mining.hit=You dig faster; the spot moves. Combos make each hit dig more.
weakspot.guide.mining.tip=The green bar below is the block's health.
weakspot.guide.repair.title=Milestones
weakspot.guide.repair.repair=Hit, then break the block: your tool gets a little durability back.
weakspot.guide.repair.milestone=From 50 to 100,000 hits: a celebration, XP and repair. Also per kind and in total. Others see yours in chat.
weakspot.guide.growth.title=Growth
weakspot.guide.growth.when=Hold right click, empty-handed, on a young crop.
weakspot.guide.growth.hit=It grows a bit (yellow bar).
weakspot.guide.growth.tip=Also cane and cacti. Chat tells you if it can't grow.
weakspot.guide.harvest.title=Harvest
weakspot.guide.harvest.when=Hold right click with an empty hand on a ripe crop. Pink spot.
weakspot.guide.harvest.hit=Harvests and replants; it turns into a growth spot.
weakspot.guide.harvest.tip=Longer combos, bigger harvests.
weakspot.guide.machine.title=Machines
weakspot.guide.machine.when=Sneak, empty-handed, and hold right click on a machine.
weakspot.guide.machine.hit=It speeds up at once; the speed shows below the crosshair.
weakspot.guide.machine.tip=Furnaces and the like show a progress bar.
weakspot.guide.animal.title=Animals
weakspot.guide.animal.when=Empty hand, hold right click on an animal. Sneak for horses.
weakspot.guide.animal.hit=Faster growing, breeding, wool, eggs, trades.
weakspot.guide.animal.tip=Villagers explain breeding.
weakspot.guide.aim.title=Aim spots
weakspot.guide.aim.place=A little away from the crosshair, alternating up/down and left/right.
weakspot.guide.aim.aim=Just aim at it. No click needed.
weakspot.guide.aim.tip=Lost it? It comes back near the crosshair.
weakspot.guide.bow.title=Bow
weakspot.guide.bow.when=While drawing a bow.
weakspot.guide.bow.hit=Draws faster. Once fully drawn, hits make the arrow stronger (up to x1.5).
weakspot.guide.bow.tip=The gauge below the crosshair shows the draw.
weakspot.guide.melee.title=Melee
weakspot.guide.melee.when=Sword or axe near enemies. Silver spot left or right.
weakspot.guide.melee.hit=Builds a charge; your next hit is a stronger critical.
weakspot.guide.melee.tip=Switching items clears the charge.
weakspot.guide.throw.title=Throwing
weakspot.guide.throw.when=Holding ender pearls, snowballs and the like. Teal spot.
weakspot.guide.throw.hit=Builds a charge; the next throw flies faster and farther.
weakspot.guide.throw.tip=Switching items clears the charge.
weakspot.guide.eat.title=Eating
weakspot.guide.eat.when=While eating or drinking. Green spot.
weakspot.guide.eat.hit=You finish sooner: two hits and you are done.
weakspot.guide.vehicle.title=Vehicles
weakspot.guide.vehicle.when=Riding a horse, pig, minecart or boat. On animals: up or down.
weakspot.guide.vehicle.hit=Speeds up, more with combos. The bar above is the time left.
weakspot.guide.vehicle.tip=Bow hits on horseback keep the boost.
weakspot.guide.ladder.title=Ladders
weakspot.guide.ladder.when=Climbing a ladder or vines. Brown spot straight up or down.
weakspot.guide.ladder.hit=You climb faster, more with combos.
weakspot.guide.sprint.title=Sprinting
weakspot.guide.sprint.when=Sprinting on the ground. Red spot straight up or down.
weakspot.guide.sprint.hit=You run faster, more with combos.
weakspot.guide.elytra.title=Elytra
weakspot.guide.elytra.when=Flying with an elytra. Blue spot.
weakspot.guide.elytra.hit=A burst toward where you look, stronger with combos.
weakspot.guide.elytra.tip=Mind the walls.
weakspot.guide.portal.title=Nether portal
weakspot.guide.portal.when=Standing in a nether portal. Gold spot.
weakspot.guide.portal.hit=Each hit cuts a second off the wait, more with combos.
weakspot.guide.swim.title=Swimming
weakspot.guide.swim.when=Swimming in water. Deep blue spot near the crosshair.
weakspot.guide.swim.hit=A short dash, then faster swimming, more with combos.
weakspot.guide.fishing.title=Fishing
weakspot.guide.fishing.when=While the bobber waits in water. Spots appear around it.
weakspot.guide.fishing.hit=Just aim at it: fish come sooner.
weakspot.guide.sleep.title=Sleeping
weakspot.guide.sleep.when=Sleeping in a bed at night. A marker on the screen.
weakspot.guide.sleep.hit=Move the cursor over it: time moves on and morning comes sooner.
weakspot.guide.sleep.tip=Time is shared by everyone.
weakspot.guide.enchant.title=Enchanting
weakspot.guide.enchant.when=With an item in the enchanting table. Purple marker around the window.
weakspot.guide.enchant.hit=Click it to reroll the three offers.
weakspot.guide.enchant.tip=Costs no lapis and no XP.
weakspot.guide.multi.title=Multiplayer
weakspot.guide.multi.others=Nearby friends' spots show as rings in another color.
weakspot.guide.multi.together=You hear their hits. Combos over 10 show above their heads.
weakspot.guide.markers.title=Markers
weakspot.guide.markers.onoff=Turn kinds off in the Markers tab of the %s menu. They go back to vanilla.
weakspot.guide.markers.look=Use ◀ ▶ in the same tab to change the color and shape.
weakspot.guide.help.title=Help
weakspot.guide.help.busy=%s turns everything off. For one kind, use the Markers tab.
weakspot.guide.help.bug=Type /weakspot bug in chat to see how to report a bug.
weakspot.guide.help.update=Chat tells you when one is out.
